43
00:11:33.420 --> 00:11:35.950
soispoke: And the second thing is, like.

44
00:11:36.380 --> 00:11:52.750
soispoke: You have 16, inclusion lists. So, yeah, best case scenario, you can include 16 different PQ transactions, per slot, which is actually not that bad, I think. Especially since in the beginning, you know, we don't expect, like.

45
